---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const repo = "https://github.com/nghxni/lightesb-camel/blob/main";
---

<BaseLayout current="/articles" title="External Agents and deterministic order routes | LightESB-Camel" headline="External Agents and deterministic order routes" description="An external Agent handles intent and candidate generation. LightESB runs ordinary Camel XML routes and exposes validation, deployment, and evidence through its CLI.">
  <article class="article-page">
    <div class="container article-layout">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="aiorder.eyebrow">Technical article</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="aiorder.title">External Agents and deterministic order routes</h1>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="aiorder.lead">An external Agent handles intent and candidate generation. LightESB runs ordinary Camel XML routes and exposes validation, deployment, and evidence through its CLI.</p>
      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="aiorder.s0.title">Separate decisions from execution</h2>
        <p data-i18n="aiorder.s0.body">Keep model credentials, conversation context, and tool selection in the external Agent. An order query or cancellation remains an ordinary business integration with explicit inputs, authorization, and a response contract.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="aiorder.s1.title">Prepare a reviewable candidate</h2>
        <p data-i18n="aiorder.s1.body">Use ai route read and ai route prepare to inspect the existing service and create a candidate outside the watched runtime directory. Preserve the actual route filename, both properties files, and referenced resources. Generate required fixed JSON Schemas through message schema generate; if warnings are non-empty, stop automatic application, show them in full, and continue only after explicit user confirmation.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="aiorder.s2.title">Validate, then apply within authorization</h2>
        <p data-i18n="aiorder.s2.body">Run ai route validate with the candidate resources. Remote application uses ai route apply --save-remote --yes only within explicit authorization. Governed changes also carry the current Action session and scope digest; a stale session is not a reason to bypass approval. Check the returned apply status and business behavior before accepting the change.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="aiorder.s3.title">Inspect evidence and preserve runtime independence</h2>
        <p data-i18n="aiorder.s3.body">Use log snapshot, log instance, and diagnostics snapshot/warnings for evidence. The reviewed route continues to serve requests when the external Agent is offline. Failed reloads and rollback outcomes must be checked through the management contract.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="aiorder.s4.title">Migrate older built-in Agents</h2>
        <p data-i18n="aiorder.s4.body">The former AiAgentDemoSrv and built-in LangChain4j execution are retired. Replace their Agent and tool endpoints with ordinary routes and external orchestration before activation. Removing a configuration switch alone does not migrate the XML.</p>
      </section>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${repo}/docs/components/12-ai-chat.md`} data-i18n="aiorder.guide">Integration and migration guide</a>
        <a class="button" href={`${repo}/docs/cli/01-cli-command-reference.md`} data-i18n="aiorder.cli">CLI command reference</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <script is:inline>
    window.pageTranslations = {
  "zh": {
    "aiorder.eyebrow": "技术文章",
    "aiorder.title": "外部 Agent 与确定性订单路由",
    "aiorder.lead": "外部 Agent 负责理解意图和生成候选；LightESB 运行普通 Camel XML 路由，通过 CLI 提供校验、部署和证据。",
    "aiorder.guide": "接入与迁移指南",
    "aiorder.cli": "CLI 命令参考",
    "aiorder.s0.title": "分清决策与执行",
    "aiorder.s0.body": "模型凭据、对话上下文和工具选择由外部 Agent 管理。订单查询或取消仍是普通业务集成，保留明确输入、授权与响应契约。",
    "aiorder.s1.title": "准备可审核的候选",
    "aiorder.s1.body": "用 ai route read 和 ai route prepare 读取现有服务，在监听目录之外准备候选。保留实际路由文件名、两个 properties 和引用资源。固定 JSON Schema 通过 message schema generate 获取；warnings 非空时停止自动 apply，完整展示内容，只有用户明确确认后才能继续。",
    "aiorder.s2.title": "先校验，再在授权范围内应用",
    "aiorder.s2.body": "携带候选资源执行 ai route validate。只有明确授权的远程变更才使用 ai route apply --save-remote --yes；受管变更还需当前 Action 会话及 scope digest，不能因会话过期绕过审批。核对 apply 状态和业务行为后再验收。",
    "aiorder.s3.title": "检查证据，保持运行时独立",
    "aiorder.s3.body": "通过 log snapshot、log instance 和 diagnostics snapshot/warnings 收集证据。外部 Agent 离线时，已审核路由仍可处理请求。加载失败与回滚结果必须按管理面契约核对。",
    "aiorder.s4.title": "迁移旧内置 Agent",
    "aiorder.s4.body": "原 AiAgentDemoSrv 与内置 LangChain4j 执行能力已退出。激活前将旧 Agent 和工具端点改为普通路由与外部编排；仅删除配置开关不能完成 XML 迁移。"
  }
};
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
